{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"90e7034ba158df3b67687c270f3351ea401c2f21f8031bf0995eac05212856a2","ja":"飲み会の目的","zh":"酒会的目的","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6703c3fcacfdc0f2beb24b69c97314a8a13dd0a8cdf16139967b8657fc160259","ja":"麗花……飲み会に行っても、\nお酒を飲んではいないのですか？","zh":"丽花……你去参加酒会，\n也都没喝酒吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3a16d27ec5510ea87293a75712481018b98c7324261b3b389b9aa348f106ca34","ja":"うん、そうだよ！\n大体、いつも1時間くらいで帰ってたし。","zh":"嗯，是啊！\n基本上平时都是1小时左右就回去了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"13b278529adf93047e53a69552eebd3411bcc66a40d1ee3485670e42bf50f53f","ja":"ええっ！？　それじゃあ、\nどうして寝不足に……？","zh":"诶！？　那为什么\n还会睡眠不足呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"75c2ec8b7f1ea6456df2b8ce96a45b41789f189103a4c0f2c85daa048fe6da49","ja":"実は今度、映画のお仕事が入ったんですけど、\nその台本が面白すぎちゃって。","zh":"其实我最近接了一份电影的工作，\n那个剧本实在是太有意思了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1ef433a1bb1eef58d36c5cc9be2501683dc60ea63a7a82eabd2395891aba15d2","ja":"ついつい夜更かしして読み込んじゃってるんです！\nえへへ♪","zh":"不知不觉就熬夜读入迷了！\n嘿嘿♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ed0f095cddc33c10ae4e7bbee4a196933f444cf03e2ed5a86c94d3a19d0143a0","ja":"映画の台本……。","zh":"电影剧本……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5052cd2597720fc76a8b3e0404e80be2e0dbda6027b22192024b6479a71e8929","ja":"うん♪　お酒が大好きで、毎日のように\n飲み会を開いてる大学生の役なんだ！","zh":"嗯♪　我演的是个特别喜欢喝酒、\n几乎每天都在办酒会的大学生！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"1c9404bb5c01d0d38c0bebb01276d4bc8b4425e2b40b7e6767ac727685e77455","ja":"だからその役の参考に、\n大学のいろんな飲み会に参加させてもらってるの♪","zh":"所以为了给那个角色找灵感，\n我去参加了大学里的各种酒会呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3740d81f8f00f6fb04979cd9cca1657c9c493069f5eea636058f9840b3998302","ja":"みんなのこと、じーっと観察してると、\nとっても参考になるんだよ♪","zh":"仔细观察大家的话，\n能学到很多东西呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"c476839158510db940c0aa221a078b6a83bab9c7a8bc9819a63a17739df1cd42","ja":"そ、そうだったんだ。でも、じーっと見られてたら、\n飲み会の人達はちょっと気になっちゃうかもね……。","zh":"原、原来是这样啊。不过，要是被一直盯着看，\n聚会的人们可能会有点不自在吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"ec75bce16fb4c3cf99d78a03920a1d4379612c21ea198c6e784203fd5f284c01","ja":"あっ、だからいつも1時間くらいで、\n「そろそろいいかな」って言われるんですね？","zh":"啊，所以才总是在1小时左右的时候，\n被您说“差不多可以了吧”对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1fd653d387c2b14cfb54f35f0ef0c471bdd3eb6e6646b3283a74839b38cf756e","ja":"ん～でも、お家で台本も読みたいし、\n観察も楽しいから、これからもそんな感じでいいかも！","zh":"嗯～不过，我也想在家里读剧本，\n而且观察也很有趣，以后继续这样可能也不错！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1274.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"a786c594b87dbfceb98afcbc8cf445ec43b767fbcd7a11478d922719a9679e95","ja":"それじゃあ今日も、\n飲み会の取材、行ってきま～す♪","zh":"那么今天我也去\n酒会取材啦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
